                                "sense_id": "ea7ffebd-8c55-3e9b-8b49-54eacaf1e692",
                                "text": "Their stationarie obambulations about the limits of parishes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bfc8d32a-88cb-4207-bead-fb67262ca12a",
                                "sense_id": "ea7ffebd-8c55-3e9b-8b49-54eacaf1e692",
                                "text": "Let us then passe the Pomeridian hours in obambulation: for I am defatigate with session."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9544c829-2ca5-40e6-8883-1d198bd124b6",
                                "sense_id": "ea7ffebd-8c55-3e9b-8b49-54eacaf1e692",
                                "text": "I joined him in one of our obambulations, to witness the performance of Macbeth, and a particular friend of my friend's friend was to sustain the principal character."
                            }
                        ]
